project/modelpool-integration: streaming-gltf ModelPool is the spoint model display path for static world/prop/environment models (entityState.model, !isDynamic) AND for VRM players (see [[vrm-multidriver-player-routing]]). createModelPool(scene,renderer,camera) in app.js (useGlobalMaterialPool:false to keep per-mesh textures); pool.update() per frame. Static models: EntityLoader pool branch parses-for-colliders only (no scene add) + modelPool.spawn(progressiveUrl), routed ONLY when the progressiveReady probe finds the baked <model>.glb.prog asset, else legacy EntityLoader render path. Players: ModelPoolAdapter.spawnVRM spawns the plain avatar url (no bake) with driveVrm:false and spoint drives features/update. ModelPoolAdapter applies transform directly on the root (quaternion + per-axis scale), NOT via ModelPool Euler/scalar opts.